ate-spatial:8.0.0.Beta1` (Hibernate ORM 7+ moved groupId).\n- The relocated artifact's Gradle module metadata imports the `org.hibernate.orm:hibernate-platform:8.0.0.Beta1` BOM with `endorseStrictVersions`, and that BOM declares constraints on **both** `org.hibernate:hibernate-spatial` and `org.hibernate.orm:hibernate-spatial` at the same version. This creates a capability/version-constraint cycle that Gradle reports as \"multiple version constraints with conflicting requirements\" whenever anything still depends on the old `org.hibernate:hibernate-spatial` coordinate.\n- I reproduced this in an isolated Gradle project: `implementation \"org.hibernate:hibernate-spatial:8.0.0.Beta1\"` fails exactly as in the CI log. Switching to `implementation \"org.hibernate.orm:hibernate-spatial:8.0.0.Beta1\"` resolves cleanly (pulls `hibernate-core`, `geolatte-geom`, etc. correctly). Adding the new coordinate *alongside* the old one still fails both — so this isn't a simple additive dependency; the existing `testImplementation \"org.hibernate:hibernate-spatial:$libraryVersion\"` line itself must be pointed at `org.hibernate.orm:hibernate-spatial` for this version.\n- The existing test code (`SpatialInitializer`, `StandardServiceRegistryBuilder`) is present unchanged in the relocated 8.0.0.Beta1 jars, so no test-code changes are needed beyond the dependency coordinate.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"action\": \"advisory_preparation\",\n  \"summary\": \"org.hibernate:hibernate-spatial:8.0.0.Beta1 is a Maven relocation POM to org.hibernate.orm:hibernate-spatial; combined with the hibernate-platform BOM's dual-coordinate constraints, depending on the old org.hibernate coordinate causes an unresolvable Gradle capability/version-constraint conflict, not a real compile error.\",\n  \"deterministic_setup\": [],\n  \"agent_guidance\": \"For this version, change the generated build.gradle test dependency from `testImplementation \\\"org.hibernate:hibernate-spatial:$libraryVersion\\\"` to `testImplementation \\\"org.hibernate.orm:hibernate-spatial:$libraryVersion\\\"`. Do not add the org.hibernate.orm coordinate alongside the old org.hibernate one — keeping both present still fails resolution, since org.hibernate:hibernate-spatial is a Gradle-metadata relocation whose target reimports a platform BOM that redeclares both coordinates, producing a version-constraint cycle. Existing test code (SpatialInitializer, StandardServiceRegistryBuilder) is unchanged in the relocated artifact and needs no source changes.\",\n  \"risks\": [\"If a future patch of hibernate-spatial 8.x un-relocates or changes the platform BOM's constraint shape, this workaround may no longer be needed or may need adjusting.\"]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":5158,"type":"result","duration_ms":147776,"uuid":"032204b6-ca47-427e-8bf3-e3e79e6fdc87","ttft_stream_ms":2138,"time_to_request_ms":67,"first_content_frame_ms":2139,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}

